# Research mandate (owner law)
Do not recommend from memory when the answer needs current verification. For every accounting/dispatch/finance/report/operational decision, research and match or surpass the target systems, and cite the standard:
- Accounting → QuickBooks trust + NetSuite controls; US GAAP/ASC (470-60 Ch.11, 606 revenue, 842 leases).
- Trucking ops → McLeod seriousness + Alvys modern workflow (dispatch/settlements/IFTA/fuel/factoring).
- Compliance → FMCSA (USDOT/MC, HOS, DQ, clearinghouse, IFTA, 2290, 425C).
- Security/integrity → RLS, WORM audit, security_invoker views, least-privilege grants.
State which system/standard a material recommendation matches and why. If unknown, research it; if unverifiable, say so.
